## 12. PSYCHOLOGY TRACKING

The system tracks five behavioral biases from trade log data:

```
1. LOSS AVERSION
   Detection: avg hold time of losses > 1.5× wins
   Correction: Follow stop losses without exception

2. EARLY EXIT BIAS
   Detection: avg win < 60% of target
   Correction: Set limit orders at target, do not watch screen

3. OVERTRADING
   Detection: > 30% of trades have confidence < 60%
   Correction: Wait for gate criteria — patience is an edge

4. REVENGE TRADING
   Detection: trade placed within 1 day of a loss
   Correction: Mandatory 24-hour cooling period after loss

5. INCONSISTENT SIZING
   Detection: position size CV > 50%
   Correction: Always use ATR-based formula, never gut feel
```

